# The module's tmpfiles rules, minus what the service unit creates itself.
#
# StateDirectory, LogsDirectory and RuntimeDirectory make the server's own
# places on every start, so they are not here (N167). These two are not the
# unit's: `/run/neuman` is root-owned on purpose, and the backup directory
# lives under the state directory but is not the server's to create.
d /run/neuman 0755 root root -
d /var/lib/neuman/backups 0700 neuman neuman -
